        "text": "Tesseract (Interstellar-style, original)\nOriginal space-organ piece in E minor: an off-kilter clock (3+3+2), an organ 'pulse' arpeggio over i–VI–III–VII, a Shepard tone that never stops rising, then a quiet bell line. Time unit = 1 beat.\nSections: drift (0–16) → fold (16–48) → collapse (48–64) → return (64–80)\nPress ▶ on the ticker (top of the list) and unmute the tones in 'Audio'."
